            new Book { BookName = "You Are a Badass", AuthorName = "Jen Sincero", Price = 11.99, GenreId = 5, Image="YouAreABadass.png", Quote="Your power begins the moment you stop doubting it.",Description="You Are a Badass by Jen Sincero is an energetic and motivational self‑help book designed to help readers break through self‑doubt and embrace their full potential. Blending humor, personal stories, and straightforward advice, Sincero encourages individuals to recognize limiting beliefs, challenge negative thought patterns, and cultivate a mindset rooted in confidence and self‑worth. She explores the power of intention, gratitude, and persistence, illustrating how small shifts in perspective can lead to meaningful life changes. The book emphasizes taking bold action, trusting intuition, and refusing to settle for mediocrity. Through practical exercises and empowering insights, Sincero guides readers toward building healthier habits, pursuing their goals with determination, and creating a life aligned with their passions. With its conversational tone and uplifting message, You Are a Badass has become a widely influential guide for anyone seeking personal growth, greater clarity, and the courage to transform their life." },
            
